WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.120
Someone once said...

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.920
There are ants like top-shelf caviar...

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.390
Caviants!

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:04.100
There are pansies with delicious 
nectar that tastes like champagne...

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:08.400
Champansies!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.540
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:18.410
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.820
Chiyo, who had joined the evil Gourmet 
Corp, arrived at Chowlin Temple.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:27.150
I've just come to say goodbye.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.120
Goodbye?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:32.290
Goodbye to all of you, who are 
about to move to the "other side".

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:36.660
Chiyo and her cohorts 
attacked Chowlin Temple.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:51.710
Meanwhile, while on Bubble Way with 
Master Chin, Toriko attained Food's End.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.050
He successfully captured Bubble Fruit.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:58.150
Not only before you eat 
or while you're eating...

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:03.360
You also respect and appreciate the 
ingredients after they're inside your body.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:07.130
And continuing to feel grateful, even 
after they become your flesh and blood,

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:11.330
that's appreciating food to the umpteenth 
degree, which is called Food's End.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.800
I didn't almost die.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.840
I <i>did</i> die.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.200
I'm so different from what 
I was until just before

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:22.270
that I can't help thinking this way.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.610
It feels like I've been reborn.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:30.380
Komatsu was happy to be reunited 
with his old friend Otake, but...

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.720
Now I can say goodbye.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:44.760
Unrivaled Strength! The One who 
Mastered Honoring the Food!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:09.090
Oh, my. You intend to keep going?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.660
You're no match for me.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.700
Where's Chin-chan?

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.900
I said, where is Chin-chan?!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.600
I won't let you...

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.840
...even bother the master!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.480
I will...

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.320
...protect Chowlin Temple!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.660
You're only an assistant instructor!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.170
Assistant Instructor Kapow!

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.440
It's fast!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.020
Hang in there, everyone!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.530
Please! Let me be in time!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.020
Honor the Food!

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.430
Instant Blood Drain!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.950
T-Too tough!

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.020
My blade broke!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.820
Take-chan... Why?!

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.560
Is something wrong?

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:46.760
No wound...

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.930
There's no wound!

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.300
Even though I felt the pain...!

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.800
It's a Revival Knife.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.340
Revival Knife?

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:59.140
The more it cuts, the more it revives.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:02.840
It's forbidden to use it like 
that in the Human World...

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.810
...but that was its original function.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:10.590
Although it's not like no one 
does because it's prohibited.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.120
It's just that there are hardly any chefs

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.620
who can use this technique.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:19.490
A forbidden technique... Why...?

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:22.860
Because there are many ingredients 
that can't be prepared otherwise...

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.470
...in the Gourmet World.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.670
Gourmet World?

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.570
That's where I am now.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.970
I believe I challenged 
you to surpass me before,

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:38.380
but it seems the gap between 
us is only widening.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:44.620
I could tell after seeing you here 
studying that stupid Honoring the Food.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.120
Stupid?!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:50.190
You're wrong!

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.960
You're wrong, Take-chan!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.760
To chefs like us, Honoring the Food

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.530
is the most important thing of all!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.310
Your important Honoring the Food...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.910
...is on the verge of obliteration right now.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:13.050
Listen, Komatsu.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.980
Those who are strong win.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.190
And winning is everything!

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.460
You're as naive as ever.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.360
You don't understand anything.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:29.160
You're the one who doesn't understand!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.300
Toriko-san and I...

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.770
We've learned the importance 
of Honoring the Food!

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:35.670
We've learned the importance of appreciation!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.700
Toriko, eh?

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.770
Come to think of it,

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:43.710
your partner is that Gourmet 
Hunter, Toriko, right?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.410
I'm light years ahead of you there, too.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.920
I'll tell you.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.680
My partner...

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:54.850
...is Gourmet Corp's...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.230
Master Chin!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:03.830
Well, well...

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.700
This is a serious situation.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.210
M-Master...

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:26.580
Master! Master!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.590
Well, well...

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.520
If it isn't Chin-chan...

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.860
Long time no see. I've been waiting for you.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.170
Granny Chiyo...

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:56.580
Granny Chiyo...

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:59.120
Why?! Why...

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:02.590
...did you join Gourmet Corp?!

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:03.690
Gourmet Corp?!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:32.210
It's been ages, but let's 
go on a date, Chiyo-chan.

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:36.680
It'll be our last date, Chin-chan.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.220
You know...

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.090
...it makes me sad to hear that.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.590
M-Master is going to change locations?

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.700
He's going to fight seriously!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.560
That's how strong his opponent...

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.130
...Chiyo-san is right now!

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:55.370
I'll be right back.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.840
Take care of the temple until then.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:05.610
Then let's go, Granny Chiyo!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.650
Master!!

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:26.700
And now it's all over, for the worthless 
history of Honoring the Food, too!

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:32.040
Don't be in such a rush, Granny Chiyo.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.540
Honoring the Food will never die.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.510
As long as there are people and food,

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:40.250
it will continue to be passed down!

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.950
Is that right?!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:49.420
Well?

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:54.660
Honoring the Food is good with appreciation, 
but can you do it even now?!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:07.710
Stop it...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.640
Stop it!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.150
Stop it!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:24.020
Stop it!!

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:46.080
Toriko-san!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.850
Sorry I'm late, Komatsu.

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.800
This is a brutal attack.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.230
Toriko-san!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.900
But it's strange...

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:15.710
Even under these circumstances,

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:18.110
I still appreciate.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.240
Toriko-san!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.080
Toriko-san!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.990
It seems he made it in time.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:34.020
In fact, I sense quite a 
presence emanating from him.

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:38.930
I bet he ate every last bit of 
the Bubble Way temple treasure.

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.100
What?! He ate the Bubble Fruit?!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.830
More importantly, he sees this situation

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:49.570
and isn't shaken, enraged, or possessing 
any other distracting thoughts.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.370
I'd say it's proof that he's perfectly 
mastered Honoring the Food.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:56.140
The way Toriko is right now,

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.750
I think we'll be okay.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:01.780
Spoon Dome!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:04.490
M-My arm!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.020
Lock!

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.220
Master...

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.400
Is that your final disciple?

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:17.500
You seem to be very confident in him.

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.100
Toriko...

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.500
That's right. Toriko...

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:27.640
I was finally able to remember his name.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.680
And the other one, Komatsu, is it?

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:36.680
Names of people who are only pretty 
good don't stick in my head.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.920
Chiyo-chan...

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:40.450
I think yours was the last 
name I remembered before them.

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:45.360
Are you saying their abilities 
are on par with mine?

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:54.000
You're wasting your time.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:59.410
I'm the only one who can 
open a locked Spoon Dome.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.740
Now then...

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.640
Let's enjoy

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.380
our final date,

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.410
Chiyo-chan!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:15.090
T-Toriko-san?

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:18.990
He's the Gourmet Hunter, Toriko...

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.960
Komatsu's partner...

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.440
T-Toriko-san!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.680
Please be careful!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.650
It's... That Scum Beast...

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.320
It isn't normal!

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:47.450
It looks savage, but it 
makes no wasted movements!

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:51.060
It's made up of dozens

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:53.560
of frighteningly powerful Beasts!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.630
And my guess is that among them

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:59.000
is something that uses a similar 
technique to Honoring the Food!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.810
Alright...

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.540
What kind of man are you...

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.650
...Toriko?

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.480
Get back, Komatsu.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.780
R-Right!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.290
He's different than the usual Toriko-san.

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:26.720
He's calm...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:36.730
My hair grew this long because of 
the nutrients in the Bubble Fruit.

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.480
Gourmet Corp...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:55.650
If I were the same man I was up to now, 
I might've snapped in this situation.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.250
Or, no...

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.320
It's not like I'm not angry...

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.230
but according to Honoring the Food,

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:07.100
heightening your emotions out of anger

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.760
produces wasteful power in the body.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.530
So I'm doing this,

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.770
feeling appreciation even for this anger!

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:22.980
To beat you, you know.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.630
It regenerated!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.170
Spiked Punch.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:47.060
I don't know what "fold" that was,

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:50.560
but it feels like I can keep going.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:52.860
Toriko-san!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.470
Unbelievable!

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.630
He destroyed that Golem with one punch!

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:00.400
I see, Toriko...

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:02.670
But if it were any other way...

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.180
...it wouldn't be worth defeating you.

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:18.890
Master! Thank goodness you're okay!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.040
Master!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:37.940
It can't be!

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:41.240
Come on, appreciation, appreciation!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:45.310
You'd better appreciate 
these circumstances, too!

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:52.350
You...

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:08.740
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:16.640
The world is spinning

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.780
A dream flower

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:25.150
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:32.590
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:36.460
Lead me by the hand

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:39.970
And take me with you

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:47.040
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.280
Red shoes

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.610
I can't take off

00:21:55.020 --> 00:22:05.930
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.860
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.330
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:18.770
Hiding Level
15

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:18.800
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 15!

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:21.570
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds!

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.040
Is everybody ready?

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:28.810
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:33.450
This is Toriko's home, Sweet House.

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:35.890
Where could he be?

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:38.820
The Hiding Level is 15, so 
it's a little difficult.

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:42.690
Well, have you found him?

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:47.830
Yun is... right here!

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:58.210
That's Level 15 for you, a really tough one!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:02.250
Next time, Toriko's in the 
final stage of battle at last!

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:04.580
What will happen in the end?!

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:09.690
This is the finest type of battle between true masters!

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:12.270
Toriko's new powers are going to erupt!

00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:16.890
"National Treasure Class" One Stroke 100 Million Yen Technique!
Toriko vs Granny Chiyo!

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:18.840
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
